WEBVTT

00:08:59.808 --> 00:09:02.310
Sababu moja wapo ninayopendelea 
kuota ndoto

00:09:02.334 --> 00:09:05.216
ni kwasababu inaniruhusu kuwa huru,

00:09:05.240 --> 00:09:09.305
bila kuhukumiwa na jamii
na kupata madhara halisi.

00:09:09.638 --> 00:09:12.640
Ninapopaa juu ya mandhari
ninazozitengeneza kwenye akili yangu,

00:09:12.664 --> 00:09:13.893
Ninakuwa na amani.

00:09:15.346 --> 00:09:17.366
Niko huru na hukumu,

00:09:17.390 --> 00:09:19.406
na ninaweza kufanya chochote nitakacho, unafahamu?

00:09:19.430 --> 00:09:24.334
ninatengeneza na Brad Pitt,
na Angelina hajali kabisa kuhusu hilo.

00:09:24.358 --> 00:09:26.238
(Kicheko)

00:09:27.759 --> 00:09:31.658
Lakini lengo la teknolojia ya 
usaidizi-usonji ni kubwa zaidi ya hilo,